// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DoctorClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1954817590" "Doctor Who?"
// DetailString :
"P1888722977" "One of the kidnappers mentioned following the doctor's plan. You questioned them but didn't get much more out of them other than he wasn't Cutter Cain. You resolve to let Interrogator Kang handle the question and answer session, but it's obvious that there is someone else pulling the strings here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SeerDeadClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P199446780" "Seer 0228"
// DetailString :
"P1774278631" "You found Seer 0228, but she was already dead. It looks like someone took a knife or a scalpel to her and tried to dig out the cybernetic implants in her head. The disturbing thing is by the look of agony frozen on her face she either woke up during the process, or was awake the entire time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Mission1Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P744266817" "Sacrifices Must Be Made"
// DetailString :
"P3569494990" "Interrogator Kang needed your help in tracking down a notorious murderer that the media dubbed "Cutter Cain". The murderer had been killing Seers for weeks and somehow managed to avoid detection. But his luck ran out when the Seers detected the thoughts of an apparent accomplice of his as they grabbed another Seer. You stormed their hideout and arrested a gathering of Resistance and Syndicate members. Unfortunately, the Seer they'd taken had already been killed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SeerClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P594827097" "Maxine's Sister"
// DetailString :
"P2065658887" "You learned from Maxine that Cutter Cain removed the cybernetic implants from her sister successfully. Maxine begged you not to return her sister to the Seer Network."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SisterClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1265679880" "Emma"
// DetailString :
"P1472141529" "You found Maxine's sister, Emma, in Pharmatek Global. She was confused, frightened, and very upset. Her removal from the Seer Network obviously had an extreme traumatic effect on her."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - LimboDeviceClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P160547394" "The Limbo Device"
// DetailString :
"P3864293876" "Maxine told you that she gave Cutter Cain the Limbo Device in exchange for freeing her sister, Emma."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Mission2Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P3840322961" "Interrogator Kang needed your help in tracking down a notorious murderer that the media dubbed "Cutter Cain". The murderer had been killing Seers for weeks and somehow managed to avoid detection. But his luck ran out when the Seers detected the thoughts of an apparent accomplice of his as they grabbed another Seer. You stormed their hideout and arrested a gathering of Resistance and Syndicate members. Unfortunately, the Seer they'd taken had already been killed.<br><br>The bust wasn't a total wash. You found some Pharmatek Global medical equipment in the hideout and learned that Cutter Cain used a device to mask himself from the Seers. Kang informed you that such devices are known as Limbo Devices, and that Pharmatek Global is registered to have such a device. You visited Pharmatek Global to see if the device was still in their possession. You discovered that not only was the device no longer there, but that the Syndicate apparently had stake in the facility. You learned from the Syndicate leader, Maxine, that she gave Cain the Limbo Device in exchange for Cain freeing her sister, Emma. Emma was in bad shape, however, after being removed from the Seer Network, so you escorted her out, fighting Syndicate security teams as you did so."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - LimboDeviceDeactivateClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P171068053" "Deactivated Limbo Device"
// DetailString :
"P1779441754" "You found the Limbo Device inside of a dumpster. Deactivating it was as simply as flipping a switch. So much trouble with just a flick of a switch."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SteffardClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2714348235" "Dr. Steffard"
// DetailString :
"P2774154243" "It turns out that Dr. Steffard is the nefarious Seer murderer 'Cutter Cain'. You caught up to him in the tunnels under Imperial City with a host of Seers that had their cybernetic implants removed. He didn't put up much of a fight."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SacrificesMustBeMadeSouvenirClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P1421652978" "An Old Kang Family Photo"
// tDetailString :
"P2730970352" "Interrogator Kang gave you a photo of himself and his daughter, Anna. It's hard to see that the young girl in the picture is now a Seer, working to keep Praetoria safe. Kang gave you the photo to remind you that in order to keep Praetoria safe:<br><br><b><color gold>Sacrifices Must Be Made</color></b><br><br>It all started when Interrogator Kang asked for your help in tracking down a notorious murderer that the media dubbed "Cutter Cain". The murderer had been killing Seers for weeks and somehow managed to avoid detection. But his luck ran out when the Seers detected the thoughts of an apparent accomplice of his as they grabbed another Seer. You stormed their hideout and arrested a gathering of Resistance and Syndicate members. Unfortunately, the Seer they'd taken had already been killed.<br><br>The bust wasn't a total wash. You found some Pharmatek Global medical equipment in the hideout and learned that Cutter Cain used a device to mask himself from the Seers. Kang informed you that such devices are known as Limbo Devices, and that Pharmatek Global is registered to have such a device. You visited Pharmatek Global to see if the device was still in their possession. You discovered that not only was the device no longer there, but that the Syndicate apparently had stake in the facility. You learned from the Syndicate leader, Maxine, that she gave Cain the Limbo Device in exchange for Cain freeing her sister, Emma. Emma was in bad shape, however, after being removed from the Seer Network, so you escorted her out, fighting Syndicate security teams as you did so.<br><br>Kang learned from Emma that Cain's hideout was somewhere down in the tunnels. Before you could go searching, however, Kang learned that the Seers had detected the Limbo Device being activated in Logos. You hunted the back alleys of Logos searching for the device and found it stashed inside of a dumpster. After deactivating it the Seers pinpointed Cain's location and directed you after him. Cain fled into the tunnels where the Resistance tried to stop you. Eventually you cornered Cain and realized that he was really Dr. Steffard, one of Praetoria City's most astounding neuroscientists. With him he had a handful of former Seers that he had removed from the Seer Network and they didn't want to go back. You apprehended Steffard and the Seers, bringing them into custody. It was then that you learned that Kang's own daughter, Anna, was one of the Seers who Steffard had freed from the Network. It was then that you truly understood what Kang meant when he said, 'We all have to make sacrifices. Some simply have more to sacrifice than others'."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3050983162" "You can tell you are too late before you even check for a pulse. The poor Seer lies crumpled on the ground. At least she seems to have found peace, despite the damage Cutter Cain and his Resistance friends did to her before she slipped away."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1332132064" "Some sicko is wandering the streets. It likes to cut things, and it's taken a liking to cutting up on Seers. TPN nicknamed <i>him</i> <color yellow>Cutter Cain</color>, but nothing so far indicates that this monster is male, or a man for that matter.<br><br>The PPD have been spinning their wheels for weeks on this case, {HeroName}. Forty Seers missing... but only two dozen bodies have shown up, so far. Cain's holding them somewhere, and then dumping the bodies around the city when it's done with them. <color orange>We've gotta find where Cain's victims are being kept and get to them before its knife does!</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3987843324" "Help Stop Cutter Cain."
// SendOffString :
"P3878622847" "We've got no perpetrators, no suspects, nothing! The Seers can't find Cain, and they never see it coming. Until now...<br><br>Cain finally slipped up. Got someone to help out and that someone got his mind read by one of our Seers, right before she disappeared.<br><br>We picked out this address from the Seer's last thought transmission. It's a warehouse in Logos. <color orange>{HeroName}, I want you to get to that warehouse and rescue that Seer before she ends up like the others.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4272989478" "Rescue Seer from Cutter Cain"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3179048918" "Autopsies confirm that the victims were alive when the implants were chopped out of them. That Cutter Cain takes pleasure in torturing its victims means there is that much extra time to save them."
// TaskTitle :
"P358593513" "<color deepskyblue>Sacrifices Must Be Made</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1396486984" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Hush, Little Girl</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1540810472" "The air carries a bitter cocktail of medical disinfectant mixed with blood."

