"P2203373325" "You finish searching the medical cart"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3481330311" "You found several bottles and syringes with Pharmatek labels."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P381739410" "You stopped the kidnappers, but were too late to save the seer they kidnapped. However, you did find a clue that could prove very helpful."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4227060845" "You found some equipment from Pharmatek Global, huh?<br><br>That would be a good logical next step. Before we do that, however, I want to see what information we can get out of those perpetrators you brought in.<br><br>So far all I've learned is that <i>Cutter Cain</i> is male, and he's a <color yellow>doctor</color>. Looks like TPN wasn't too far off."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MaxineDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2719719589" "{HeroName}, please, don't take my sister back there!"
// Answer Text :
"P890862557" "Where's the Limbo Device?"
// Page LimboPage1 Text :
"P3461016603" "We gave it... gave it to... Cain."
// Answer Text :
"P2503015193" "Tell me about Cutter Cain."
// Page LimboPage2 Text :
"P2624976164" "A... Good man. Saved my sister... from... Mother Mayhem."
// Answer Text :
"P2525889777" "Who is your sister?"
// Page SisterPage1 Text :
"P3799740557" "She... she was a Seer. Cain... he saved her. Rescued her really. Please... don't take her away from me... again."
// Answer Text :
"P1007069923" "Outside of the Seer Network she's dangerous."
// Page SisterPage2 Text :
"P1083405373" "How... can you... be sure of that?<br><br>Look... look at me, at the... Syndicate. Our power... it is in check."
// Answer Text :
"P1836520574" "Your power is used for selfish ends. Theft, kidnapping, murder..."
// Page SisterPage3 Text :
"P4293440753" ""And how... is that... Any different... than what... Mother does... with her Seers...?" <color orange>Maxine passes out.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1522717047" "If you can't see the difference, then I pity you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3846973149" "According to one of the Syndicate thugs you brought in, <i>Doctor</i> Cain is using some sort of device to block Seer precognition. That's how he surprises them.<br><br>I had <color yellow>Alec Parson</color> over at MICIR do some digging and it appears that there is such a device. It's called a <color yellow>Limbo Device</color>. Praetor Tilman had them outlawed years ago.<br><br>I'd bet my salary that Cain got his from Pharmatek Global, along with the rest of his equipment.<color orange>I want you to visit the Pharmatek Global facility here in Logos.</color> They supposedly have a Limbo Device for <i>research purposes</i>, make sure they still have it."
// AcceptString :
"P3159983785" "Visit Pharmatek Global"
// SendOffString :
"P4210641476" "<i>Doctor</i> Cain, is working with the Resistance and the Syndicate. His motives don't seem to be about murdering the Seers but rather to find a way to remove their cybernetics without killing them in the process. This is of value to both the Resistance and Syndicate. According to one of the Resistance terrorists you captured, Cain already has a few successful cases under his belt.<br><br>My suspicion is that Doctor Cain is selling Seers to the Syndicate, and having the Resistance help with the heavy lifting. In return, both groups benefit: The Resistance has less Seers to deal with, and the Syndicate get new recruits into their organization.<br><br><color orange>Find those Seers and he has nothing to sell, he'll get desperate, and then he'll make a mistake.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P412924830" "Investigate Pharmatek Global"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3612115817" "You need to get that thing taken care off we talked about earlier."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2269641699" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Finders Keepers</color>"

