// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3832379864" "You rescued a former Seer and discovered that Cutter Cain is none other than Doctor Steffard, and he has the Pharmatek Global Limbo Device."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4286389112" "So Cutter Cain does have the Limbo Device.<br><br>Cain has no doubt gone into hiding now that we've started hitting close to the mark. Luckily your provided us with someone who has been there before. We have some Seers trying to calm her down right now, but I think information will be forthcoming.<br><br>Ah, there's a call now."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P453075153" "The Seers went through the mind of the Seer you rescued and she recalls some time down in the tunnels. I was about to send a few squads of PPD search teams down there to look for signs of Cain, but then one of our Seers went offline in Logos. Cain's struck again.<br><br>We've managed to triangulate a position for the location of the Limbo Device blocking the precognition. <color orange>If you can find and deactivate the Limbo Device then the Seers will be able to find Cutter Cain and you can take him out!"
// AcceptString :
"P227022945" "Find the Limbo Device"
// SendOffString :
"P243827856" "Locating the limbo device is the easy part. Grabbing Cain will be the tricky part.<br><br>Once you've disabled the Limbo Device the Seers will be able to direct you to his location."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P466736230" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Hide and Seek</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
