"P1133575664" "You begin searching for the Limbo Device..."
// interactcompletestring :
"P488679219" "You have finished searching."
// interactactionstring :
"P3118590011" "Rooting through trash..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2052481283" "You found the Limbo Device and deactivated it. Almost instantly you hear the Seers direct your thoughts toward tracking down Cutter Cain."

