// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - StopCain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3910154591" "Stop Cutter Cain"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1201345417" "You defeated Dr. Steffard, aka Cutter Cain."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1592181661" "You arrested Dr. Steffard and recovered the Seers he had removed from the Seer Network."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P358262075" "Cutter Cain was Dr. Steffard... I can hardly believe it.<br><br>I spoke with Steffard briefly, to try and learn why he did what he did. He was trying to give the Seers a chance to live their own lives. Part of me agrees with him, but the safety of Praetoria requires that we <i>all</i> sacrifice for the greater good.<br><br>I told you I had a daughter, didn't I, {HeroName}?<br><br>Her name was Anna. She was one of the Seers that was kidnapped by Steffard... He successfully removed her from the Seer Network.<br><br> {HeroName}, there is nothing more that I want than to see my little girl again, to hear her laugh, to hug her, to ask her how her day has been... but she is a Seer. To try and change that would violate everything I believe in, and I believe in Praetoria, {HeroName}.<br><br>We all have to make sacrifices. Some simply have more to sacrifice than others."
// RandomFameString :
"P3017292952" "I heard that that murderer, Cutter Cain, was brought to justice."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
